title: "Awesome System One Models: A Curated, Evidence-Graded List of Typed Probabilistic Decision Models"
abstract: "A curated and evidence-graded list of System One models (typed probabilistic decision models), organized by the survey's genealogy, anatomy, census, evidence ledger, failure atlas, design patterns and reporting checklist. The list reflects the survey cutoff of 28 October 2026."
